Amazon EC2 Systems Manager, Amazon CloudWatch, AWS CloudTrail, and AWS Clou=
dFormation. AWS Local Zones also provide a high-bandwidth, secure connectio=
n to the AWS Region, allowing you to seamlessly connect to the full range o=
f services in the AWS Region through the same APIs and toolsets.</p>

