ou avoid downtime during deployment, and handles the complexity of updating=
 your applications. You can use AWS CodeDeploy to automate deployments, eli=
minating the need for error-prone manual operations, and the service scales=
 with your infrastructure so you can easily deploy to one instance or thous=
ands.</p>

