physical data centers and servers, you can access technology services, such=
 as computing power, storage, and databases, on an as-needed basis.</p>

<p>By using cloud computing, you can achieve a lower variable cost than you=
 can get on your own. Because usage from hundreds of thousands of customers=
 is aggregated in the cloud, providers such as AWS can achieve higher econo=
mies of scale, which translates into lower pay-as-you-go prices.</p>

