count applied to the use of On-Demand Instances in your account. You can pu=
rchase a Reserved Instance (RI) for a one-year or three-year commitment, wi=
th the three-year commitment offering a bigger discount. A reserved instanc=
e (RI) cannot be interrupted. So this is the correct option.</p>

